cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SEARCH-ML, please cite it as below."
title: "SEARCH-ML: Screening & Ensemble Analysis for Receptors and Chemical Hits with Machine Learning"
abstract: >-
  A stacked machine-learning ensemble (XGBoost, CatBoost, Random Forest, LightGBM and a
  Ridge meta-model) for high-throughput forward and reverse virtual screening of
  protein-ligand binding affinity.
type: software
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-15
authors:
